### login

# @name login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/users/login

{
  "username": "{{ADMIN_USER}}",
  "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### current user

GET {{BASE_URL}}/users/auth
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.cookies.access_token.value}}

### renew access token

POST {{BASE_URL}}/tokens/renew
Cookie: refresh_token={{login.response.cookies.refresh_token.value}}

### logout

POST {{BASE_URL}}/users/logout
Cookie: refresh_token={{login.response.cookies.refresh_token.value}}
